{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52527","headline":"喜雨次曹泉州 · 陈元光","name":"喜雨次曹泉州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上帝将垂谴，边臣惊不宁。\n旁徨劳野马，乾曝俯龙亭。\n精意馨穹昊，阳和正郁蒸。\n絪緼云作瑞，黮𪒘雨成声\n原湿枯随发，生灵死复苏。\n刑牲崇礼报，作颂庆昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}